    <string name="help_title">Help</string>
    <string name="help_content">[As Receiver (TV/Tablet)]
1. Open CastLink to the standby screen
2. Note the 4-digit PIN (refreshes every 5 minutes)
3. Keep this screen in foreground, wait for sender

[As Sender (Phone)]
1. Join the same Wi-Fi as the receiver
2. Pick a nearby device on the home page, enter its 4-digit PIN
3. Grant screen capture permission to start

[iPhone Mirroring]
Control Center → Screen Mirroring → pick CastLink-TV, enter PIN

[File Push]
Open the URL on the standby screen (e.g. http://192.168.1.x:8756) in a browser and upload

[Troubleshooting]
• Device not found: check same Wi-Fi, or enter IP manually
• Wrong PIN: PIN refreshes every 5 min, check the receiver\'s current one
• Laggy cast: move closer to router or lower sender resolution</string>

